claim.claim-text:
a warp estimator (101) for estimating a first warp parameter sequence for the first and the second frame and for estimating a second warp parameter sequence for the second frame and the third frame;
a spectral analyzer (102) for deriving first spectral coefficients for the first and the second frame using the first warp parameter sequence and for deriving second spectral coefficients for the second and the third frame using the second warp parameter sequence;
a warp coder (104) for encoding the first warp parameter sequence and the second warp parameter sequence; and
an output interface (106) for outputting the representation of the audio signal including the encoded first warp parameter sequence, the encoded second warp parameter sequence, and the first and the second spectral coefficients.

a warp decoder (202) for decoding a first encoded warp parameter sequence to derive the first warp parameter sequence and for decoding a second encoded warp parameter sequence to derive the second warp parameter sequence;
a spectral value processor (204) for deriving a first combined frame using the first spectral coefficients and the first warp parameter sequence, the first combined frame having information on the first and on the second frame, and for deriving a second combined frame using the second spectral coefficients and the second warp parameter sequence, the second combined frame having information on the second and the third frame; and
a synthesizer (604) for reconstructing the second frame by adding the first combined frame and the second combined frame.

estimating a first warp parameter sequence for the first frame and the second frame and for estimating a second warp parameter sequence for the second frame and the third frame;
encoding the first warp parameter sequence and the second warp parameter sequence;
deriving first spectral coefficients for the first frame and the second frame using the first warp parameter sequence and deriving second spectral coefficients for the second and third frame using the second warp parameter sequence; and
outputting the representation of the audio signal including the encoded first warp parameter sequence, the encoded second warp parameter sequence, and the first and the second spectral coefficients.

decoding a first encoded warp parameter sequence to derive the first warp parameter sequence;
decoding a second encoded warp parameter sequence to derive the second warp parameter sequence;
deriving a first combined frame using the first spectral coefficients and the first warp parameter sequence, the first combined frame having information on the first and on the second frame;
deriving a second combined frame using the second spectral coefficients and the second warp parameter sequence, the second combined frame having information on the second and the third frame; and
reconstructing the second frame by adding the first combined frame and the second combined frame.
